---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import imgClubBienvenida from '../assets/club-mascotas-bienvenida.jpg';
---

<section
  id="club-newsletter"
  class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 my-10 sm:my-16"
  aria-label="Club Market-Pet Descuento"
>
  <div
    class="relative rounded-3xl sm:rounded-4xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-linear-to-br from-rose-600 via-rose-700 to-stone-950 border border-rose-500/30 text-white"
  >
    {/* Fondo decorativo con brillos sutiles */}
    <div
      class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-rose-400/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/3 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-400/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>

    {/* Layout Split de 2 columnas: Lado izquierdo textos/formulario, lado derecho fotografía */}
    <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
      {/* Columna Izquierda: Información, Beneficios y Formulario (7 columnas) */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/15 text-white text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider backdrop-blur-md border border-white/25">
          <span>✨</span>
          <span>CLUB MARKET-PET · BENEFICIO EXCLUSIVO</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Únete y obtén{' '}
          <span class="text-amber-300 underline decoration-amber-300/50 decoration-wavy">
            $5.000 de descuento
          </span>{' '}
          en tu primera compra
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/90 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Tu mascota merece consentimientos especiales. Al suscribirte recibes un cupón de bienvenida inmediato, ofertas secretas para socios y consejos prácticos de veterinarios certificados.
        </p>

        {/* 3 Micro-beneficios con checks */}
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 pt-1">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/25 text-white/95 text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/10">
            <span class="text-amber-300 font-bold">✓</span> Cupón de $5.000 inmediato
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/25 text-white/95 text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/10">
            <span class="text-amber-300 font-bold">✓</span> Ofertas flash exclusivas
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/25 text-white/95 text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/10">
            <span class="text-amber-300 font-bold">✓</span> Consejos de salud y nutrición
          </span>
        </div>

        {/* Formulario de Suscripción */}
        <form
          class="pt-3 space-y-2.5 max-w-lg"
          onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('🎉 ¡Felicidades! Te has unido al Club Market-Pet. Hemos enviado tu cupón de $5.000 a tu correo.');"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2.5">
            <div class="relative flex-1">
              <label for="newsletter-email-input" class="sr-only">Correo electrónico</label>
              <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3.5 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-stone-400">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-none stroke-current stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="newsletter-email-input"
                required
                placeholder="tu-correo@ejemplo.cl"
                class="w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-stone-900 placeholder-stone-400 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-3 focus:ring-amber-300 shadow-inner"
              />
            </div>

            <button
              type="submit"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300 text-stone-950 text-sm font-black shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-102 transition-all cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              ¡Obtener mi cupón! →
            </button>
          </div>

          <p class="text-[11px] text-white/70 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span>🔒</span>
            <span>Cero spam. Respetamos tu privacidad y puedes cancelar en cualquier momento con un clic.</span>
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>

      {/* Columna Derecha: Tarjeta Fotográfica de Mascotas con Voucher (5 columnas) */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm sm:max-w-md rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-2 border-white/30 transform hover:scale-102 transition-transform duration-300">
          <Image
            src={imgClubBienvenida}
            alt="Perro y gato felices con cupón de $5.000 de bienvenida"
            width={600}
            height={620}
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
